
### Current

Run `./build_release` to create the single-file `release/pshell` executable.
It bundles boto3 and its dependencies; users do not need to install them.
It requires Python 3 and extracts its contents to a private temporary directory
while running, which is removed on normal exit.

The build includes separate dependency sets for Python 3.6-3.12 and Python
3.13 or later. Build on a platform compatible with the target system and its
Python runtime.

Run it with `./release/pshell`.
After building, run `python3 test_release.py` to check the packaged executable.


### Docker

docker build -t pshell .
docker run -it --rm pshell

